    old "Hetero Girls (Single)"
    new "Chicas Hetero (Solteras)"

    old "Single hetero girls respond to Love, Obedience, and Inhibition equally. Build Love through chatting, gifts, and spending time together. Higher Love means she accepts more intimate acts willingly. This is the most straightforward path."
    new "Las chicas hetero solteras responden al Amor, Obediencia e Inhibicion por igual. Construye Amor con conversaciones, regalos y tiempo juntos. Mas Amor significa que acepta actos mas intimos voluntariamente. Este es el camino mas directo."

    old "Girls with Boyfriends"
